ji-084-qujia:p024","quote":"共承嘉惠兮，俟罪長沙。側聞屈原兮，自沈汨羅。造讬湘流兮，敬弔先生。遭世罔極兮，乃隕厥身。嗚呼哀哉，逢時不祥！鸞鳳伏竄兮，鴟梟翺翔：闒茸尊顯兮，讒諛得志；賢聖逆曳兮，方正倒植。世謂伯夷貪兮，謂盜跖廉；莫邪為頓兮，鉛刀為銛。于嗟嚜嚜兮，生之無故！斡棄周鼎兮寶康瓠，騰駕罷牛兮驂蹇驢，驥垂兩耳兮服鹽車。章甫薦屨兮，漸不可久；嗟苦先生兮，獨離此咎！"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line015-pei02-01","text":"《吴书》曰：翻闻曹公辟，曰：“盗跖欲以餘财污良家邪？”遂拒不受。","text_layer":"witness_appended_pei_songzhi_note","mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line015-pei02-01:m0006","start":6,"end":7,"surface":"翻","kind":"person","person_id":"izi_e36_p1g","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line015-pei02-01:m0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"曹公","kind":"person","person_id":"dad_b77_b38","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line015-pei02-01:m0015","start":15,"end":17,"surface":"盗跖","kind":"person","person_id":"xu5_0nl_f5z","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段姓名與上下文定位。"}],"annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":15,"last_line":15,"revision_id":2638131,"raw_start":2060,"raw_end":2092,"character_positions":[2060,2061,2062,2063,2064,2065,2066,2067,2068,2069,2070,2071,2072,2073,2074,2075,2076,2077,2078,2079,2080,2081,2082,2083,2084,2085,2086,2087,2088,2089,2090,2091]},"attribution":{"annotator":"裴松之","attribution_kind":"quoted_work","source_label":"吳書","attribution_marker":"《吴书》曰：","quoted_work":"吳書"},"attachment":{"received_paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan:line015","received_codepoint":80,"note_ordinal":2,"source_ordinal":1},"chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-057-yufan","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-057","work_id":"w-sanguozhi","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-057-yufan"},{"id":"c-shiji-084-qujia:p024","text":"共承嘉惠兮，俟罪長沙。側聞屈原兮，自沈汨羅。造讬湘流兮，敬弔先生。遭世罔極兮，乃隕厥身。嗚呼哀哉，逢時不祥！鸞鳳伏竄兮，鴟梟翺翔：闒茸尊顯兮，讒諛得志；賢聖逆曳兮，方正倒植。世謂伯夷貪兮，謂盜跖廉；莫邪為頓兮，鉛刀為銛。于嗟嚜嚜兮，生之無故！斡棄周鼎兮寶康瓠，騰駕罷牛兮驂蹇驢，驥垂兩耳兮服鹽車。章甫薦屨兮，漸不可久；嗟苦先生兮，獨離此咎！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter",